        "footnotes": [
          {
            "marker": "2",
            "text": "Maximum Spectacle Blind size shall be 12NPS. A blind and spacer shall be used for larger pipe sizes. Spectacle Blind material shall be A516 Gr 70N. For low temperature service, material shall be Charpy Y-notch tested at temperatures no warmer than the minimum allowable operating temperature."
          },
          {
            "marker": "4",
            "text": "See Owner's Specification GS 2.10 for Nondestructive Examination requirements. When the amount of radiographic examination is less than 100%, the progressive examination requirements of B31.3 Clause 341.3.4 or CSA Z662 Clause 7.10.3.1 shall apply."
          },
          {
            "marker": "5",
            "text": "Maximum allowable temperature 100\u00b0C."
          },
          {
            "marker": "16",
            "text": "For glycol and hot oil service, use SW fittings, except valves which may be threaded."
          },
          {
            "marker": "18",
            "text": "A53 Gr. B Pipe may be substituted with approval. (ERW for NPS 12-18, DSAW for NPS 20-24). Check wall thickness."
          },
          {
            "marker": "24",
            "text": "If using SW flanges, bore to match pipe."
          },
          {
            "marker": "26",
            "text": "For FF Flanges use Class 150 - 3 mm THK Full Face Gaskets, \"Klinger\u00ae 1000\", \"Durlon-8600\" or \"Garlock 3150\"."
          },
          {
            "marker": "28",
            "text": "RFSO flanges may be substituted with approval."
          },
          {
            "marker": "29",
            "text": "For treated de-ironized boiler feed water upstream of the deaerator, use 304L stainless steel pipe and fittings with 316 stainless steel valves."
          },
          {
            "marker": "31",
            "text": "Use Flat Faced (FF) flanges in firewater service or when mating to cast iron flanges."
          }
        ],
